(Introduction) Tj
T*
(?Sila is a global, open-source platform for decentralized applications. On) Tj
T*
(Sila, you can write code that controls digital value, runs exactly as programmed,) Tj
T*
(and is accessible anywhere in the world.?) Tj
T*
(From https://sila.org/) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(This report documents the results of a consulting exercise completed by Cure53 for the) Tj
T*
(Sila \(SIL\) team. The project was carried out in December 2019 and January 2020) Tj
T*
(and mostly focused on the Sila Node Discovery Protocol v5.) Tj
T*
(In terms of resources, Cure53 was awarded a pool of ten days that could be used for) Tj
T*
(testing. To date, five days have been used by two members of the Cure53 team involved) Tj
T*
(in this exercise. This means that there is a remaining budget of five days that can still be) Tj
T*
(allocated by Sila to further work.) Tj
T*
(To make sure that the exercise fits in with the goals and interests of Sila, the) Tj
T*
(consulting work was accompanied by a kick-off, several meetings and communications) Tj
T*
(enabled by the Discord server maintained by the Sila team, specifically through a) Tj
T*
(dedicated channel \(#discv5\) that was opened for the purpose of sharing exercise-related) Tj
T*
(details. The two members of the Cure53 joined the channel, yet it should be stated that) Tj
T*
(one had a managerial and administrative role, while the other performed the tasks) Tj
T*
(related strictly to the consulting and analysis.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Cure53, Berlin ∑ 01/24/20) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(1/4) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
() Tj
